extension/DESIGN.md is an unmodified copy of design-md/mintlify/DESIGN.md from
https://github.com/VoltAgent/awesome-design-md, used under the MIT License below.
extension/entrypoints/sidepanel/tokens.css is adapted from extension/DESIGN.md:
a dark color set (the source has none for UI surfaces), error, warning and
green-as-text colors darkened or lightened to meet WCAG AA, and IBM Plex Mono in
place of Geist Mono. Each adapted value is marked in tokens.css.

